keywords = {2 there have been,a plethora of studies,and cri 3,antiferromagnetism,density functional theory,ferromagnetic materials cr 2,fi de,ge 2 te 61,ince the discovery of,magnetic anisotropy,monte carlo simulation,on two-,transition metal phosphorus trisul,two-dimensional magnetic material,u},
